  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable Agricultural Development Program for Marginal Farmers in Central Luzon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This program aims to uplift the livelihood and socioeconomic well-being of marginal farmers of Central Luzon through research for development, value chain analysis and development, socio-economic profiling and analysis, gender and development analysis, support for irrigation facilities and other agricultural facilities, trainings and assistance</narrative>
  </description>
